review:
I slept on this game for the longest time, but now, having played it for just a few hours, I can safely say this is the quintessential CoD game on PC.

The full package for this 2015 game has:
- A decent length campaign that, although the story itself isn't the best, has full co-op support, custom loadouts and challenges;
- A multiplayer mode with a vast variety of maps and weapons (though many are locked behind the black market), alongside specialists who don't feel out of place and progression that ACTUALLY rewards the player, including weapon camos, specialist cosmetics and calling cards;
- A Zombies mode that contains every single map from World at War and Black Ops 1 + its own original maps, which are some of the best of the best in CoD's history;
- A fourth mode that's a series of varied challenges that exists for no reason other than because it can, giving the player a fun distraction from the three core modes;
- Fully editable custom emblems;
- Fully editable custom paintjobs for your guns;
- A decent variety of gamemodes, which also includes...;
- ... In-depth customization of private matches, including a hub for sharing custom gamemodes;
- And, to top it all off, OFFICIAL MOD TOOLS AND FULL MOD SUPPORT, STEAM WORKSHOP INCLUDED!

This game is a blessed package. Yeah, it sucks that Activision is a company ruled by a sexist pedo that threatens to kill his secretary on the daily, never lowering the price on this game. And yeah, it sucks that there's a damn season pass and a market for some in-game content. BUT DON'T SLEEP ON BO3! The gameplay is fantastic, being the best futuristic CoD of the bunch, and every part of it feels as if it was made with love.

There are a few performance issues related to recent updates, but fan patches have aided with the situation. It's honestly equally surprising and depressing how this game has more value than the current CoD title.

Besides, the base game is worth it thanks to the Workshop alone!

[b]EDIT (May 22nd, 2023):[/b] Rapistvision has shut down SM² and X Labs. It's only a matter of time until H1 Mod and Plutonium come next. Fuck Activision. Pirate their games and make sure to pirate BO3 ;)
